            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Descend on a Web"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(move)\n\nThe hunting spider moves straight down up to 40 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage. A creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 3, 5 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall."
